{
  "lecture_id": "lecture-04",
  "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "更受约束的架构把学习限制在较小的映射集合内；只要真实映射仍可表达，结构约束就可能减少仅靠数据排除错误解的负担。好的架构还需便于梯度搜索与并行计算。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 6
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "不同网络拟合信号的表现差异不能自动归因于表示能力，因为逼近能力和优化能力在实验中通常耦合。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "语义分割要求每个像素有输出。小块定位细，却可能看不清对象；大而重叠的块让每个输出保持密集，同时获得较大上下文。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 18
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 19
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 22
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "复用相同局部规则意味着输入平移后输出标签图相应平移。分类式不变读出是不同目标，不能把二者混写。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 23
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 36
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 50
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "每个位置的输出由邻域像素加权组合；若相同相对位置复用同一核，就形成卷积。矩阵表示因此带重复约束并减少自由参数。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 24
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 27
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 28
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 29
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 32
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "卷积层先跨输入通道汇集局部响应，再通过多个滤波器产生多个输出特征图；各图表现相应滤波器在空间位置上的响应。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 31
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 41
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "平移等变、块处理、图像滤波、权重共享与可变尺寸张量处理是同一卷积结构的行为、算法和参数化视角。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 34
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 36
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "单个卷积输出依赖局部邻域，堆叠后深层单元依赖更大输入范围；逐点非线性不扩展空间依赖，而下采样会加快相对感受野增长。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 37
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 62
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "空间池化聚合邻近位置，可增加对小位移的容忍并降低分辨率；跨通道池化则聚合不同滤波器响应，可对方向等特征变化形成另一类不变性。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 48
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 50
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 52
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 53
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "步幅卷积或池化把运算和下采样合并，降低内存及计算；课堂材料同时展示步幅增大可能造成混叠和边界消失。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 56
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 58
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 59
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "扩张卷积拉开核内部采样点，以较少参数覆盖较大输入范围，但它并不等同于稀疏输出位置的步幅下采样。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 60
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "编码端下采样并提炼表示，解码端上采样恢复空间输出；对于分割等图像到图像任务，过强瓶颈可能丢失细节。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 67
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 69
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 71
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "U-Net 在镜像尺度间按通道拼接早期激活以保留高频定位信息；ResNet 将输入路径与块变换相加，让块学习修正量。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 68
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 70
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 71
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "不希望模型忽略绝对位置时，可以换用非平移不变架构或把位置加入输入。神经场直接从连续坐标返回场值；课程以颜色场与颜色加体密度为例。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 76
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 77
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 78
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 79
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 80
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "formulas": [],
  "objectives": [
    "用假设空间图分析结构约束、数据量、逼近能力和优化效果之间的边界。",
    "由逐像素分类严格区分局部处理、共享权重、平移等变与任务级不变性。",
    "从矩阵约束、多通道特征图、滑动滤波和可变输入尺寸统一解释卷积层。",
    "评估池化、下采样、步幅、扩张及深度对分辨率、混叠、感受野和计算的影响。",
    "为图像到标签、图像到图像和坐标到场值任务选择合适架构，并论证跳跃连接或位置输入。"
  ],
